<title>JAPAN: Output at big Japan aluminium mills rises in Oct.</title>
<headline>Output at big Japan aluminium mills rises in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Output of fabricated aluminium products at Japan's seven leading mills rose 6.2 percent in October from the same month last year to 131,279 tonnes, according to data submitted by the companies to the Japan Aluminum Federation and released on Monday.</p>
<p>The October data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     Oct 96	 yr/yr change</p>
<p> Total	    131,279	  +6.2 pct</p>
<p> Flat-rolled    102,683	  +4.7 pct</p>
<p>   Can stock     31,586	  +8.8 pct</p>
<p> Extrusions	28,596	 +11.6 pct</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
